@startuml
title v0001-executor-docker - local Docker Executor topology

participant "Mocked task server" as Mock
participant "Docker Executor" as Ex
participant "Docker daemon" as Docker
participant "Agent container" as Child

Ex -> Mock : register executor_type=docker, capacity, running_child_count
Ex -> Mock : poll next task
Mock --> Ex : task_spec
Ex -> Docker : create/start container from agent OCI image
Docker -> Child : run agent runtime
Ex -> Docker : observe child status
Ex -> Mock : post running/terminal status and running_child_count

note over Ex
  No Router, State Registry, Env Registry,
  Web UI, auth, or Kubernetes support in this change.
end note

@enduml
